						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Nothing scheduled for Seattle yet, but will post if there is. <br /><br />You can also check the tour schedule page for updates: <br /><a href="http&#58;//www.burningspearuhuru.com/tours/mfanelo-skwatsha07/schedule.html" target="_blank">http://www.burningspearuhuru.com/tours/mfanelo-skwatsha07/schedule.html</a><br /><br />Mfanelo Skwatsha or another representative from the PAC will be touring the U.S. again in the spring as well. </td>
