							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left"><b>Uhuru News Tribute to Marcus Mosiah Garvey</b><br /><br />August 17th, 2007 marked the 120th Birthday of Marcus Garvey.<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />Watch Uhuru TV&#039;s new video on the true history of the Garvey Movement.<br />Video link: <a href="http&#58;//uhurunews.com/tv/?program=garvey_tribute" target="_blank">http://uhurunews.com/tv/?program=garvey_tribute </a><br /><br /><img src="http://www.uhurufiles.org/UhuruRadioNewsletters/images/marcus-garvey_200w.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></td>
