							</td>
							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php#1">MASS LINE FORUMS</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?board=3.0">By Any Means</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3012.msg34562#msg34562">Africanist Movement establishes program for 2007 Sierra Leone elections!</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: August 02, 2007, 01:20:56 pm
